# This subtree builds and runs on Erlang/BEAM under WSL/Linux. The repo sets
# core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite shell scripts to CRLF on a Windows
# checkout and break them under WSL bash (verified: a CRLF smoke.sh dies with
# "set: pipefail: invalid option name"). Pin shell scripts to LF so the smoke
# gate (FR-007) runs everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
